Date: Thu, 20 Nov 2025 19:42:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Implement comprehensive responsive design system across
 the Shortly app

- Completed extensive responsive design improvements for optimal user experience on all devices.
- Enhanced responsive utilities in `utils/responsive.ts` and `utils/layoutUtils.ts`.
- Updated 50+ screens and components to ensure fluid adaptability to various screen sizes and orientations.
- Introduced smart scaling algorithms for width, height, font size, and border radius.
- Established device detection system for tablets and landscape modes.
- Created detailed documentation including guidelines, summaries, and validation checklists for future reference.
